    "ch06_s02"
   ],
   "evidence_quotes": {
    "ch01_s01": "Mortimer is a successful, elderly medical man, well-esteemed since those who know him give him this mark of their appreciation.” “Good!” said Holmes.",
    "ch04_s02": "Mortimer looked at Holmes with an air of professional interest, and Sir Henry Baskerville turned a pair of puzzled dark eyes upon me.",
    "ch06_s02": "Mortimer has read to us, and avoid the moor in those hours of darkness when the powers of evil are exalted.” I looked back at the platform when we had left it far behind and saw the tall, austere figure of Holmes standing motionless and gazing after us."
   }
  },
  {
   "source": "frankland",
   "target": "lafter",
   "type": "기타",
